<view class="page page--no-tab phone-page">
  <view class="nav-header"><button class="nav-back" bindtap="goBack">‹</button><view class="nav-title"><text class="nav-title__brand">时间电话</text><text class="nav-title__sub">拨给过去某一天的自己</text></view><text class="status-pill {{connected ? '' : 'status-pill--muted'}}">{{connected ? '已接通' : '未拨号'}}</text></view>

  <view class="phone-hero {{calling ? 'is-calling' : ''}}">
    <image src="/images/feature-time-phone-v2.jpg" mode="aspectFill" />
    <view class="phone-hero__shade"></view>
    <picker class="phone-date-wrap" mode="date" value="{{date}}" end="{{maxDate}}" bindchange="onDateChange"><view class="phone-date">拨号日期 · {{dateLabel}} <text>⌄</text></view></picker>
    <view class="phone-hero__copy"><text>{{calling ? '正在跨越时间检索记忆…' : connected ? modeLabel + ' · 可见 ' + eligibleMemories.length + ' 条早期记忆' : eligibleMemories.length + ' 条记忆可以被过去的你看见'}}</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="rule-card"><text class="rule-title">只看得到 {{dateLabel}} 及以前</text><text class="rule-copy">之后发生的事情会被隔离，回答不会偷看未来。</text></view>

  <view class="question-card paper-card"><text class="question-label">你想问过去的自己什么？</text><textarea class="question-input" value="{{question}}" maxlength="300" auto-height placeholder="例如：你现在最担心什么？" bindinput="onQuestionInput" /><scroll-view scroll-x enable-flex><view class="chip-row"><button class="chip" data-question="你现在最担心什么？" bindtap="useQuestion">当时最担心什么？</button><button class="chip" data-question="你最希望未来的我记住什么？" bindtap="useQuestion">想让我记住什么？</button><button class="chip" data-question="如果能给未来的我一句话，你会说什么？" bindtap="useQuestion">给未来一句话</button></view></scroll-view><button class="primary-button call-button" loading="{{calling}}" bindtap="call">{{calling ? '正在拨号…' : '拨打时间电话'}}</button></view>

  <view wx:if="{{answer}}" class="answer-letter paper-card"><view class="letter-stamp">{{date}}</view><text class="letter-title">来自 {{dateLabel}} 的回答</text><text class="letter-content">{{answer}}</text><view class="evidence-box"><text class="evidence-title">这通电话可见的最近记忆</text><text wx:for="{{evidenceMemories}}" wx:key="_id">• {{item.date}} · {{item.title}}</text><text wx:if="{{!eligibleMemories.length}}">• 没有任何早期记忆，回答会明确说明信息不足</text></view></view>
  <view class="data-source-note"><text>⏳</text><text>“过去的你”是受时间边界约束的生成式角色，不是真实录音或意识复刻。</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading-mask"><view class="paper-card loading-card"><text class="loading-sprout">☎️</text><text class="loading-text">正在连接时间线路…</text></view></view>
</view>
